            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\n`MiniColors.add_transparency()` is mostly designed to work [with built-in groups](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/decd729b784c4f6cb775da335f3c8eecb846250c/doc/mini-colors.txt#L418). Making exceptions for 'mini.nvim' is possible, but might be not very sustainable in the long run. I'll think about it.",
